    "%lld fps" : {
      "comment" : "Burst rate in the camera screen's menu. The placeholder is frames a second."
    },
    "%lld frames" : {
      "comment" : "A choice in the bracket's Frames menu, and its label. The placeholder is the number of frames (5 to 20).\nA count of frames: under a stack's name, on a Library tile, in the camera's status, under a folder in the Add Frames sheet. The placeholder is how many; zero reads 'No frames'.",
